  "title": "Bank of America Now Accepting Proposals for 2027 Art Conservation Project",
  "summary": "Bank of America is now accepting proposals for its 2027 Art Conservation Project through Sept. 30, 2026. The program provides grant funding to nonprofit museums, cultural institutions and conservation organizations undertaking projects to preserve historically or culturally significant artworks and artifacts.",
